# Git attributes: keep the repository line-ending-neutral across Windows/Linux dev
# machines and GitHub's checkout of this repository (Chinese-locale MSVC + CRLF churn
# is one of this project's documented pitfalls; text=auto normalises on commit).
* text=auto

# Binary assets: never diff/convert them (the README GIFs are already palette-optimised).
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ppm binary

# Windows entry points keep CRLF so a plain double-click / older editors behave.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# POSIX scripts and CI stay LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
